  "title": "Slow Cooker Beef Stew Al la Catherine",
  "description": "Everyone loves beef stew, especially when it's as easy to prepare as combining beef, onion, carrots, potatoes, and canned soup in a slow cooker and letting the appliance handle it from there. Check the footnote if you've gone paleo.",
